{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"centripetal-force-calculator UI copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","detected_language":"tl","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"centripetal-force-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","keys":["centripetal-force-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer"],"locale":"fil","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Ang centripetal force ay naglalarawan ng inward net force na kailangan para sa pabilog na galaw sa isang inertial frame. Ang “Centrifugal force” ay isang maliwanag na outward force na ginagamit sa isang umiinog na reference frame.","record_id":"4d1c3d800bf55fb5a0eab301e2bd5846f7468b844088012ec35a892d03aac407","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":4.319655858375029,"source":"Centripetal force describes the inward net force needed for circular motion in an inertial frame. “Centrifugal force” is an apparent outward force used in a rotating reference frame.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"c6925c518fa8691d01224b6b38d8308545b8b1278ec14914c7c2e59a19d62a39","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Ang centripetal force ay naglalarawan ng inward net force na kailangan para sa pabilog na galaw sa isang inertial frame. Ang “Centrifugal force” ay isang maliwanag na outward force na ginagamit sa isang umiinog na reference frame.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
